From 9d8690f6c28dbc4c012600a33a16a7e8727b20aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Santosh Kumar Adhikari <santoshkumaradhikari@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:06:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix all issues from the 2026-08-29 site audit

Accessibility & correctness:
- Dark mode: table headers were near-invisible (1.29:1 contrast) - now use ink colour
- scope=col on all data-table header cells (121 chapters)
- Audio player: aria-pressed state + polite aria-live status announcements
- No-JS: audio buttons hidden via noscript instead of relying on JS to hide them
- Inline onclick handlers replaced with data-print + delegated listener (CSP-safe)
- Mobile: header nav is one scrollable row instead of wrapping to three rows

Trust & currency:
- Investment disclaimer added to the shared footer of every Canon page
- One unified footer - removed the stale 'new chapters are added as drafted' copy
- Every chapter shows First published / Last verified dates from git history,
  mirrored into datePublished/dateModified in the Article JSON-LD
- Primary-data-sources note (NRB, SEBON, NEPSE, CDSC, IRD) on every chapter

Sharing & SEO:
- favicon.svg, apple-touch-icon, theme-color on every page
- og:image + twitter:image (1200x630 branded card)
- og:locale corrected to en_GB; twitter:card upgraded to summary_large_image
- Hub schema upgraded WebPage -> Book with all 121 chapters as hasPart
- BreadcrumbList JSON-LD on every chapter

Navigation & usability:
- Hub: client-side title filter over the 121 chapters
- Hub: per-chapter reading-time pills replace the uniform Read-now labels
- Chapters: heading ids + In-this-chapter mini-TOC for deep-linking
- Whole Book nav link now warns it is ~5 MB; book.html rebuilt with a single h1
- Hero copy honest about the count: 121 chapters incl. Part 0

Performance:
- Google Fonts payload trimmed to the weights the CSS actually uses
