   <p>A good pre-trade checklist for the NEPSE investor should cover four categories: thesis, price, sizing, and process. Below is a working template. It is deliberately short — six to eight questions — because a checklist with forty items will not survive contact with a busy trading day. The discipline is in always using it, not in making it exhaustive.</p>
