 <article class="chapter bk-chapter" id="ch-79">
 <div class="chapter-kicker">Part XV · Chapter 79</div>
-  <h1>The Backtesting Mindset</h1>
+  <h2 class="bk-ch-title">The Backtesting Mindset</h2>
+  <p class="chapter-dates">First published 25 Aug 2026 · Last verified 29 Aug 2026</p>
