   <h3>Why Sub-Indices Matter More Than You Think</h3>
   <p>For the disciplined NEPSE investor, the sub-index is often a more actionable tool than the headline NEPSE Index. Each sub-index tells a story about the specific macroeconomic, regulatory, and sectoral forces affecting that group of companies. Understanding what drives each sub-index — and how sub-indices interact — is fundamental to building and managing a portfolio intelligently.</p>
