   <p>The reason this chapter exists inside Part XVIII rather than standing alone is that a data pipeline is not useful in isolation. Its entire value is in how cleanly it hands off to the tools built in the four preceding chapters, and it is worth walking through that handoff explicitly so the whole Part reads as one system rather than four separate exercises plus a filing chore.</p>
