   <p>The preceding seven lessons have described a set of adversarial mechanisms. This final lesson translates them into actionable defences. None of these rules guarantee that you will never be harmed by market manipulation — in a market like NEPSE, some exposure is unavoidable. But following these rules consistently will dramatically reduce the frequency and severity of the harm you absorb.</p>
