+    <tr><th scope="col">Dimension</th><th scope="col">Favourable Signal</th><th scope="col">Unfavourable Signal</th></tr>
     <tr><td>Shareholding trend</td><td>Stable or rising promoter stake through open-market or fully-subscribed rights participation</td><td>Declining stake via OTC sale outside of a clear, disclosed, benign reason</td></tr>
