@@ -152,6 +164,18 @@
   <p>A disciplined investor applies a repeatable promoter-quality scorecard — shareholding trend, pledging disclosure, rights-issue history, board composition, related-party transparency, payout consistency, regulatory history, and research coverage — at every results cycle and corporate action, treating governance analysis with the same rigor as ratio analysis, because in NEPSE's current institutional environment, the individual investor's own diligence remains the first and often the only line of defence against promoter-driven value extraction.</p>
