     <span class="callout-label">MARKET REALITY</span>
     The retail investor's practical problem is not merely "is this rumour true?" It is that even a true rumour, reacted to late in its diffusion cycle, places you as the marginal buyer at the top of an insider-originated, socially amplified price move — the classic position of the last, uninformed buyer before a reversal.
   </div>
