     The income statement of a Nepali company should always be read alongside its sector's governing regulator's format. Banks follow NRB's prescribed format under the Unified Directives; insurers follow the Nepal Insurance Authority's format; hydropower companies follow the general NFRS-based format with no sector-specific regulatory template, which is itself informative — it means hydropower income statements have more year-to-year presentational variance between companies than bank or insurer statements do.
   </div>
