   <p>The second, and the larger effect for anyone holding a meaningful position, is order-book depth, or the lack of it. Picture a simplified order book for a thin counter:</p>
   <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
   <table class="figures">
-    <tr><th>Price level (NPR)</th><th>Buy orders waiting (shares)</th></tr>
