     Build a simple float tracking sheet for every stock you hold or are evaluating, with four columns: total shares outstanding, promoter + locked-in %, free float %, and free float market cap in NPR. Update it whenever the company reports, and whenever you know a lock-in expiry has passed (Lesson 57.6). This sheet becomes the second gate — alongside your ADV sheet from Chapter 56 — that every position must clear before you size it.
