   <p>You do not need to build a file for every company on NEPSE. Build one for every company you own, and for every company on your watchlist (the shortlist of companies you are seriously considering, introduced conceptually in earlier chapters). A file with ten well-maintained companies is worth far more than a spreadsheet listing all 200-plus listed companies with a single stale number next to each name.</p>
