   <p>None of this requires expensive software. For the overwhelming majority of Nepali retail investors, a spreadsheet — whether a free tool like Google Sheets or a copy of Microsoft Excel — is entirely sufficient to run the whole system described in this chapter. The strategies in this book do not depend on speed. They depend on discipline, and a spreadsheet is more than fast enough to support discipline.</p>
